B.a8a=new A.bS("Begin at once to live, and count each day as a separate life.","Seneca")
B.a7E=new A.bS("The quality of your life is the quality of your habits.","James Clear")
B.a8g=new A.bS("Win the morning, win the day.","Tim Ferriss")
B.a7B=new A.bS("Discipline is choosing between what you want now and what you want most.","Abraham Lincoln")
B.a81=new A.bS("We are what we repeatedly do. Excellence, then, is not an act, but a habit.","Aristotle")
B.a85=new A.bS("Your future is created by what you do today, not tomorrow.","Robert T. Kiyosaki")
