B.adM=new A.aS("Two Years After a Job Loss: Long-Term Impact of the JOBS Program on Reemployment and Mental Health","Vinokur, A. D., Schul, Y., Vuori, J., & Price, R. H.","Journal of Occupational Health Psychology, 5(1), 32-47",2000,"https://doi.org/10.1037/1076-8998.5.1.32","A structured job-search programme improved both reemployment and mental health two years later, with the largest benefits among those at highest risk of depression. Structure applied to the search itself - not just its outcome - carried the effect.")
