B.ZH=s(["That's one. \ud83c\udf31","Noted. That counts. \u2705","Nice - that's done now. \u2728","Good. That's a real thing you did today. \ud83c\udf1f","Ticked. Nothing else required. \ud83d\ude42","That's the hard part over. \ud83d\udca7","One down, whenever the next one comes. \ud83c\udf43","You showed up for that. \ud83c\udf24\ufe0f","Small and done beats big and someday. \ud83c\udf31","That's on the board. \ud83d\udcd7","Done is done. No notes. \ud83d\udc4c","Whatever else today holds, that happened. \u2600\ufe0f","Kind of you, to yourself. \ud83e\udd0d","That'll do nicely. \ud83c\udf3e","Logged. Go easy on the rest. \ud83c\udf0a","Good one. The next can wait. \ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f","That's enough to count as a start. \ud83c\udf05","Every one of these is optional, and you did it anyway. \u2728","Quietly done. \ud83c\udf19","That's something. It's genuinely something. \ud83c\udf3b"],t.s)
