B.adP=new A.aS("Counting Blessings Versus Burdens: An Experimental Investigation of Gratitude","Emmons, R. A. & McCullough, M. E.","Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 84(2), 377-389",2003,u.bM,"Participants who wrote weekly gratitude lists exercised more, had fewer physical complaints, and felt more optimistic than those who recorded hassles or neutral events over 10 weeks.")
B.aev=new A.aS(u.v,u.bX,"American Psychologist, 60(5), 410-421",2005,u.T,'The "Three Good Things" exercise - writing three things that went well and why - increased happiness and decreased depressive symptoms for six months after just one week of practice.')
