B.ad7=new A.lb("Stretching","5 shoulder rolls + neck tilt (60 seconds)","Micro-mobility breaks reduce musculoskeletal tension by 28% compared to no movement - duration matters less than frequency.","\ud83e\uddd8")
B.ad3=new A.lb("Meditation","3 slow box breaths (inhale 4s, hold 4s, out 4s)","Controlled breathing activates the parasympathetic nervous system within 90 seconds - equivalent to 5 min of seated meditation for acute stress.","\ud83e\udec1")
B.ad4=new A.lb("Movement breaks","Stand up and sit back down once","Breaking up sitting time matters more than the length of each break - interrupting a long sit at all improves glucose handling and afternoon alertness.","\ud83d\udeb6")
B.ad0=new A.lb("Something you enjoy","Two songs you like, doing nothing else","Activity scheduling works by doing the thing first and letting the mood follow, not the other way round. The size of the activity is not what carries the effect.","\ud83c\udfa8")
B.ad5=new A.lb("Contact with someone","Send one message. It does not need a reply","Brief, low-stakes contact carries a surprising share of the benefit of social connection. The reply is not the active ingredient.","\ud83d\udc65")
